  <item>
    <title>饭嘀咕vol.78| 科技减肥，减肥更简单了吗？聊聊 GLP-1 的光与影</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ba8f655faf368659281606</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ba8f655faf368659281606</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Sep 2025 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>明星都在打，好莱坞、硅谷抢着用，全球制药巨头赚得盆满钵满——这就是火爆全网的“减肥神药”GLP-1受体激动剂类药物。</span></p><span></span><p><span>GLP-1到底有多神？ 它为什么能让人轻松掉秤？它会是肥胖终结者吗？它会取代饮食和运动吗？这期节目，我们和你一起揭开这针的</span><strong><span>魔力、代价以及平替法</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【推荐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>之前节目里推荐过科普书，出最新中文版本啦～</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://item.jd.com/15106254.html" data-url="https://item.jd.com/15106254.html"><span>戳这里就能购买《肥胖密码》</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmGpzTSQIDjTvQ5scI1b2C0o5Ho6.png"></figure><span></span><h2><strong><span>时间线</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="461">07:41</a> “神药”到底有多神？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="878">14:38</a> GLP-1的发现之旅：被嫌弃的“垃圾鱼”到炙手可热的新药王</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2111">35:11</a> GLP-1会是肥胖终结者吗：什么人适合？如何最大限度避免副作用并保住瘦身车刚过</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3017">50:17</a> 提升GLP-1的天然方法</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/620222fb67cdf3fb2bad062f/lh0tjB7tNOdeiVfQBhOpl4JBX99t.m4a" length="55139529" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkQp9xsEVHCCZSukLpcuEvp96FNs.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
